      "start_line": 41,
      "text": "  rule appendCandidate(VS:ValSeq, V:Val)\n    => valSeqConcat(VS, vCons(V, .ValSeq))\n    requires isInt(V)\n     andBool scanBad(0, intOf(V)) ==Int 0"
